OL,3,GNEWSAPolice to use facial recognition
OL,4,Aat Illuminations
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire Police is to use Live Facial
OL,7,FRecognition (LFR) for the first time at
OL,8,FBlackpool Illuminations.
OL,10,FThe technology scans faces in crowds
OL,11,Ffrom a live camera feed and checks them
OL,12,Fagainst a watchlist of wanted people.
OL,14,FThe force said it would be in use ahead
OL,15,Fof and during the Illuminations
OL,16,Fswitch-on concert, an outdoor event on
OL,17,Fthe Tower Festival Headland on 4
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
