OL,3,GNEWSAPolice to use facial recognition
OL,4,Aat Illuminations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesman said the technology
OL,7,Fwas a "vital tool" for helping officers
OL,8,Fquickly identify and apprehend people
OL,9,Fwho pose the greatest risk to
OL,10,Fcommunities.
